  "description": {
   "en": "The historical comedy manga, set during the end of the Edo period, depicts the Father of the Japanese Police—Toshiyoshi Kawaji. Within the mob hidden in the shadows of history, a samurai who gave up being a samurai risks his own life, and fights the information warfare for a bigger cause.",
